  },
  "why": "The T5 write-up quoted '36 of 100 names cannot be shorted at any price'. Both halves were wrong in the strategy's disfavour-sounding but analytically loose direction: 100 is not the denominator the rule ever meets, and 'at any price' is not what a broker flag measures. Corrected here from the same checkpoints, so the cost model can quote a number that is true.",
